  "Infinity Link Chain": "Infinity Link Chain",
  "Infinity links, set with diamonds, in rose and in white.": "Infinity-schakels met diamanten, in roségoud en in witgoud.",
  "Links in the shape of infinity, each one paved with diamonds, joined by polished bars. The same chain is made in rose gold and in white gold, worn alone or together.": "Schakels in de vorm van oneindigheid, elk met diamanten bezet, verbonden door gepolijste staafjes. Dezelfde ketting bestaat in roségoud en in witgoud, alleen of samen gedragen.",
  "The Infinity Link chain in rose gold and in white gold, on a bust": "De Infinity Link-ketting in roségoud en in witgoud, op een buste",
