  "BRT Flowers": "BRT Flowers",
  "The signature chain of the house, in two widths.": "De signature-ketting van het huis, in twee breedtes.",
  "BRT Flowers is the signature chain of Berete Jewellers. Along twisted links in rose gold, paved with diamonds, run flowers of round diamonds with leaves of marquise-cut diamonds. Its rectangular clasp is paved with diamonds around the BRT mark; seen from the back, it is polished smooth.": "BRT Flowers is de signature-ketting van Berete Jewellers. Langs gedraaide schakels in roségoud, bezet met diamanten, lopen bloemen van ronde diamanten met bladeren van diamanten in marquiseslijpvorm. De rechthoekige sluiting is rond het BRT-merk met diamanten bezet; van achteren is ze glad gepolijst.",
  "It is made in two widths, 12 mm and 16 mm. It is the chain of the Sirius piece, and the one Kevin Schade wears.": "Ze bestaat in twee breedtes, 12 mm en 16 mm. Het is de ketting van het stuk Sirius, en die van Kevin Schade.",
  "Widths": "Breedtes",
